! complex-lit: complex literals are non-standard
  @ test.idl:3:33

 2 │ typedef sequence<long> LongSeq;
 3 │ const LongSeq NUMBERS = { 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 };
   │               ˆˆˆˆˆˆˆ   ˆˆˆˆˆˆˆˆˆˆˆˆˆˆˆˆˆ complex constants are non-standard
